{"id": "d8240e50-a75a-46b3-b7f9-e32ee2f41120", "slug": "ai-features-showcase", "title": "AI Features Showcase", "description": "Features Showcase Background Effect is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"AI Features Showcase\"\ndescription: \"Features Showcase Background Effect is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#01C497\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FACC15\"\n  background: \"#0A0C10\"\n  surface: \"#2A2D3A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#2A2D3A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# AI Features Showcase\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 2; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, css, animated, visual, effect.\n## Overview\nFeatures Showcase Background Effect is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAI Prompt to Vector Motion Copilot Raster to Vector Figma Integration Keyframe Generation AI Prompt to Vector Motion Copilot Raster to Vector Figma Integration Keyframe Generation Motion Copilot Type animation prompts i…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Motion Copilot; AI Prompt to Vector; Raster to Vector for Figma; AI Raster to Vector.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #01C497, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FACC15, background #0A0C10, surface #2A2D3A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>AI Features Showcase</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Iconify (Solar Linear) -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js for WebGL Background -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            teal: '#01C497',\n                            dark: '#111318',\n                            card: '#15171E',\n                            border: '#2A2D35'\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0A0C10] text-white min-h-screen relative font-sans overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-brand-teal selection:text-white\" style=\"margin: 0;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #111318 0%, #0A0C10 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Wrapper (z-10 to sit above WebGL) -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center min-h-screen pb-24\">\n\n        <!-- Marquee Section -->\n        <div class=\"w-full overflow-hidden py-12 border-b border-white/5 bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-sm mb-16\">\n            <div id=\"marquee-container\" class=\"flex w-max\" style=\"display: flex;\">\n                <!-- Duplicated Marquee Items -->\n                <div class=\"marquee-inner flex items-center gap-16 px-8 text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 tracking-wide uppercase\">\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-lg\"></iconify-icon> AI Prompt to Vector</span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:video-frame-play-horizontal-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-lg\"></iconify-icon> Motion Copilot</span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-lg\"></iconify-icon> Raster to Vector</span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:figma-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-lg\"></iconify-icon> Figma Integration</span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clapperboard-play-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-lg\"></iconify-icon> Keyframe Generation</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"marquee-inner flex items-center gap-16 px-8 text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 tracking-wide uppercase\">\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-lg\"></iconify-icon> AI Prompt to Vector</span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:video-frame-play-horizontal-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-lg\"></iconify-icon> Motion Copilot</span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-lg\"></iconify-icon> Raster to Vector</span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:figma-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-lg\"></iconify-icon> Figma Integration</span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clapperboard-play-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-lg\"></iconify-icon> Keyframe Generation</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Cards Grid -->\n        <div id=\"cards-container\" class=\"w-full max-w-6xl px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1: Motion Copilot -->\n            <div class=\"feature-card group rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent hover:from-brand-teal/30 hover:to-transparent transition-all duration-500\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"bg-brand-card rounded-3xl h-full p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl\">\n                    <!-- Icon -->\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:smart-speaker-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Copy -->\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">Motion Copilot</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                        Type animation prompts in various languages and turn them into keyframes seamlessly.\n                    </p>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white transition-colors mt-auto mb-8\">\n                        Try Motion Copilot\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n\n                    <!-- Graphic Representation -->\n                    <div class=\"h-44 bg-[#1E212B] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 p-4 relative shadow-2xl overflow-hidden group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\">\n                        <!-- User prompt bubble -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#2A2D3A] rounded-xl p-3 border border-white/5 w-[90%] mb-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-circle-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-300\">You</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">\n                                Animate this layer like a bell, moving from left to right, slowly and then faster\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Floating 3D-like Bell -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-28 h-28 bg-[#111318] rounded-xl border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(250,204,21,0.15)] z-10\" style=\"transform: rotate(-5deg);\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-bing-bold\" class=\"text-yellow-400 text-5xl drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(250,204,21,0.5)]\"></iconify-icon>\n\n                            <!-- Small generation badge -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute -top-3 -left-3 w-8 h-8 bg-[#1E212B] rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:verified-check-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: AI Prompt to Vector -->\n            <div class=\"feature-card group rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent hover:from-brand-teal/30 hover:to-transparent transition-all duration-500\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"bg-brand-card rounded-3xl h-full p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl\">\n                    <!-- Icon -->\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chat-square-call-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Copy -->\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">AI Prompt to Vector</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                        Convert text prompts into captivating AI-generated vector graphics on Lottie Creator and Figma.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <!-- Graphic Representation -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto h-44 bg-[#1E212B] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 p-4 relative shadow-2xl flex flex-col group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-gray-500 mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide\">Generate an image from a text prompt</span>\n\n                        <!-- Input field -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-xs text-black mb-3 flex items-center font-medium shadow-inner\">\n                            A yellow bell <span class=\"w-[1px] h-3 bg-brand-teal ml-1 opacity-70\" style=\"animation: blink 1s infinite;\"></span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Mini options grid -->\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-gray-500 mb-2\">Choose a type</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-3\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-[#2A2D3A] border border-brand-teal/50 flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-teal/20 to-transparent\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pen-new-square-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-[#2A2D3A] border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:ghost-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-[#2A2D3A] border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-[#2A2D3A] border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:crown-star-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Generate Button -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-brand-teal/90 rounded text-center py-1.5 text-white text-[0.65rem] font-semibold flex justify-center items-center gap-1 mt-auto shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(1,196,151,0.2)]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-linear\" class=\"text-xs\"></iconify-icon> Generate\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Floating Generated Asset -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -right-6 w-24 h-24 bg-[#111318] rounded-xl border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(1,196,151,0.1)] z-10\" style=\"transform: translateY(-50%);\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-bold\" class=\"text-yellow-400 text-4xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <div class=\"absolute -top-2 -right-2 w-6 h-6 bg-brand-teal rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg border border-[#111318]\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-linear\" class=\"text-white text-xs\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: Raster to Vector -->\n            <div class=\"feature-card group rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent hover:from-brand-teal/30 hover:to-transparent transition-all duration-500\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"bg-brand-card rounded-3xl h-full p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl\">\n                    <!-- Icon -->\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-brand-teal text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Copy -->\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">Raster to Vector for Figma</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                        Transform raster images into scalable vector graphics effortlessly with the Raster to Vector feature in the LottieFiles for Figma plugin.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <!-- Graphic Representation -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto h-44 bg-[#1E212B] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 relative shadow-2xl flex flex-col group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Figma Plugin Header -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 border-b border-white/5 bg-[#15171E]/50\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                                <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-brand-teal rounded flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-bold\" class=\"text-white text-[0.4rem]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-medium text-gray-300\">LottieFiles</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-circle-linear\" class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Tabs -->\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between px-3 py-1.5 border-b border-white/5 text-[0.55rem] text-gray-500\">\n                            <span>Discover</span>\n                            <span>Workspaces</span>\n                            <span>Export</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-white font-medium border-b border-white pb-[1px]\">Tools</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Content Area -->\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 text-center relative\">\n                            <h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-white mb-1\">AI Raster to Vector</h4>\n                            <p class=\"text-[0.55rem] text-gray-500 mb-3\">Convert raster images to vector graphics effortlessly.</p>\n\n                            <!-- Drag & Drop Zone -->\n                            <div class=\"w-full border border-dashed border-gray-600 rounded-lg py-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-[#15171E]/50 relative\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:gallery-add-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg mb-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-[0.6rem] text-gray-400\">Select an image from your design</span>\n\n                                <!-- Fake cursor interacting -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 right-8 animate-pulse text-brand-teal drop-shadow-lg z-20\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-minimalistic-bold\" class=\"text-lg rotate-[-20deg]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Action Button -->\n        <button class=\"cta-button mt-16 bg-brand-teal text-white font-medium text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-[#00E5AA] transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(1,196,151,0.2)] hover:shadow-[0_4px_25px_rgba(1,196,151,0.4)] flex items-center gap-2 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5\">\n            Learn more about AI features\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n        </button>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Blinking Cursor Keyframe for Graphic 2 -->\n    <style>\n        @keyframes blink {\n            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n            50% { opacity: 0; }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- Interactions and Animations Script -->\n    <script>\n        // 1. WebGL Background Setup (Three.js)\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 15;\n\n            // Renderer\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Particles\n            const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 1200;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n                // Spread particles in a wide subtle field\n                posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 40;\n            }\n\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n            const particlesMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.03,\n                color: '#01C497',\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.25,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, particlesMaterial);\n            scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n            // Mouse interaction setup\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = event.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5;\n                mouseY = event.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5;\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Slow rotation\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.02;\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x = elapsedTime * 0.01;\n\n                // Subtle parallax on mouse move\n                camera.position.x += (mouseX * 2 - camera.position.x) * 0.05;\n                camera.position.y += (-mouseY * 2 - camera.position.y) * 0.05;\n                camera.lookAt(scene.position);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Resize handling\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // 2. GSAP Animations\n        const initGSAP = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Infinite Marquee\n            const marqueeInner = document.querySelectorAll('.marquee-inner');\n            gsap.to(marqueeInner, {\n                xPercent: -100,\n                repeat: -1,\n                duration: 25,\n                ease: \"none\"\n            });\n\n            // Cards Stagger Animation\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"#cards-container\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\",\n                    toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                }\n            });\n\n            tl.fromTo(\".feature-card\",\n                { y: 60, opacity: 0, scale: 0.95 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, scale: 1, duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.15, ease: \"power3.out\" }\n            )\n            .fromTo(\".cta-button\",\n                { y: 30, opacity: 0 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 0.6, ease: \"power2.out\" },\n                \"-=0.4\"\n            );\n        };\n\n        // Initialize scripts on load\n        window.onload = () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initGSAP();\n        };\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "ai-features-showcase.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/ai-features-showcase.jpg", "source_name": "ai-features-showcase-DESIGN.md", "views": 74, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T05:57:22.169954+00:00"}